From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Niklas Sheth <hi@niklassheth.com>
Date: Sun, 25 Oct 2026 00:18:42 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] drm/asahi: G16: remove the firmware-memory cache maintenance
 path

fw_cache_maint=0 has been the default since #149: G16 firmware and client
memory is coherent, as writeback user BOs are, and only barriers are
needed. The =1 path (dc civac/cvac on firmware writes, reads and page
initialization) and the per-page dirty tracking that fed it did nothing at
the default. Remove the parameter, its debugfs file, clean_page and the
region dirty lists. Page-table, TTB and handoff cleans stay, as before.
Production behaviour is unchanged.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
